Super+Enter              terminal (st)
Super+Shift+Enter        floating terminal
Super+d                  run a program (dmenu)
Super+w                  web browser
Super+q                  close the window
Super+Shift+e            leave dwm (back to the console)
Super+/                  this list
Super+j / k  (Down/Up)   focus the next / previous window
Super+Shift+j / k        move the window down / up the stack
Super+h / l  (Left/Right) master area smaller / larger
Super+Space              swap the window with the master
Super+i / Super+Shift+i  more / fewer windows in the master area
Super+t                  tiling layout
Super+m                  monocle layout (one window at a time)
Super+Shift+f            floating layout
Super+f                  fullscreen
Super+Shift+Space        float / unfloat the window
Super+b                  hide / show the bar
Super+minus / equal      smaller / larger gaps (Super+Shift+equal resets)
Super+1..9               go to tag 1..9
Super+Shift+1..9         send the window to tag 1..9
Super+Ctrl+1..9          show tag 1..9 as well
Super+Tab                previous tag
Super+0                  every tag at once
Super+comma / period     focus the previous / next monitor
Super+Shift+comma/period send the window to the previous / next monitor
Super+drag               move a window (left button) / resize it (right button)
